Package: mainuan-aparencia
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mainuan <mainuan@localhost>
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtqml, python3-pyside6.qtquick, dbus-bin | dbus, qt6-svg-plugins, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-qtcore, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Recommends: plasma-workspace, libkf6kcmutils-bin
Description: Mainuan appearance settings
 Standalone version of the Appearance page of Mainuan Welcome. Switch the
 system theme between light and dark (with the matching Mainuan wallpaper),
 pick the accent colour and visual style, choose among nine desktop layouts
 (including macOS and Windows 11 styles that only change panels) and
 manage the desktop wallpaper. The window follows the system light/dark mode.
